NEXUS EVENT MECHANICS
=================
  a Nexus Event is any act that leaves the scripted path
  late to work
  a kindness a Loki was never meant to keep
  theft of the Tesseract
  size is irrelevant
  only the deviation matters

  the fork begins at the instant of choice
  that instant is the Nexus
  the growing line after it is the branch

  untreated Nexus
      variance energy accumulates
      the branch thickens
      lives on it become real
      a Kang may be born on it
      Multiversal War becomes possible again

  apocalypse camouflage
      a world already doomed hides variance
      Pompeii
      Lamentis-1
      Sylvie lived inside endings for centuries
      the monitors see only the destined death
      not the fugitive walking through it

  known spike
      two Lokis choose each other on a dying moon
      care where a Loki should stand alone
      the branch climbs past any prior reading

NEXUS EVENT REDLINE
=================
  redline is the lock
  before it the fork can still be burned
  after it the universe exists
  Reset Charges will not take
  the Sacred cannot reclaim the matter

  TVA doctrine
      prune while the line is orange
      never let it go red
      red means a new Kang-capable world

  what crosses redline
      the branch is no longer a stain
      it is a timeline
      people on it have futures
      pruning after lock is slaughter of a world
      not cleanup of an error

  He Who Remains threshold
      redline was drawn where his other selves
      become statistically inevitable
      not where morality ends
      where his monopoly ends

  after the tree
      redline is no longer the law of existence
      branches live past lock
      the TVA marks red only for
          incursion
          Kang birth
          dynasty assembly

