TEMPORAL LOOM MECHANICS
=================
  the Loom sits beyond the TVA proper
  a ring that drinks raw timeline matter
  and tries to weave it into one throughput

  designed purpose
      accept only Sacred-compatible strands
      reject or delete the rest
      keep He Who Remains as the only Kang

  throughput
      branches enter as raw temporal radiation
      the ring spins them into a single braid
      excess heat dumps off the gantry
      too many strands and the ring screams

  scaling lie
      the TVA believes the Loom can be enlarged
      Multiplier devices
      more rings
      more throughput
      infinity cannot be sized
      the machine was never built for a free multiverse

  true function
      failsafe
      when overloaded it does not grow
      it cuts
      every branch that is not Sacred dies
      the TVA dies with them
      only He Who Remains path remains

  collapse sequence
      He Who Remains falls
      Nexus Events go untreated
      branches multiply past redline
      radiation climbs
      the ring cannot braid infinity
      implosion
      time unspools toward one leftover thread

  Loki's override
      he walks the gantry
      tears the ring apart
      the strands go dark
      he takes them in his hands
      green seidr lights each dying line
      he carries the bundle through the rift
      to the empty Citadel
      sits
      the braid becomes a tree
      the Loom is gone
      the god is the loom now

ALIOTH
=================
  origin
      born in the first Multiversal War
      not a beast of one world
      a storm grown from leftover time
      every pruned life
      every deleted hour
      fed it

  He Who Remains did not slay it
  he bound it
  set it at the End of Time
  made the Void its pasture
  every Reset Charge is an offering
  Alioth eats the evidence of other Kangs

  nature
      cloud
      lightning
      hunger without speech
      it does not judge
      it consumes what is declared leftover

  enchantment
      a mind can ride the storm
      Sylvie learned the trick in hiding
      Lokis used it to open the path
      through the Void to the Citadel

  after the tree
      less meat falls from the sky
      the TVA prunes fewer worlds
      Alioth remains
      the End of Time still has a mouth
      Renslayer last seen facing its light

